cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Rang in your work, please cite it."
title: "Rang: color palettes from Persian art"
abstract: >-
  Rang is a collection of color palettes drawn from Persian art, including
  carpets, miniature paintings, tilework, manuscripts, ceramics and
  architecture. Every palette traces to a documented source photograph and
  ships for Python, R, ArcGIS Pro, QGIS, GeoLibre and HEC-RAS.
type: software
